{"vid":"Xr2uEZrKfx8","source":"Xr2uEZrKfx8.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":7.6,"txt":"All industrial equipment is designed so"},{"t":12.2,"txt":"that anybody can fix it."},{"t":15.2,"txt":"All industrial equipment is easy to fix."},{"t":17.7,"txt":"All of it."},{"t":28.2,"txt":">>"},{"t":35.8,"txt":">> The most surprising thing I've learned"},{"t":37,"txt":"through my experiences an automation"},{"t":38.5,"txt":"electrical technician at some big name"},{"t":40.4,"txt":"companies is that 90% of the problems"},{"t":43,"txt":"you'll find really are not that"},{"t":44.8,"txt":"complicated. And with this video, I just"},{"t":46.9,"txt":"want to take about 5 minutes to show you"},{"t":49.4,"txt":"a few quick very simple trick tricks and"},{"t":52.4,"txt":"tips"},{"t":53.4,"txt":"that will allow you to fix probably 75%"},{"t":56.4,"txt":"of faults out there. And I'm going to"},{"t":58.2,"txt":"try and blow something up on this video,"},{"t":60.2,"txt":"so that would be kind of cool."},{"t":62.8,"txt":"All right, so this video we're going to"},{"t":63.9,"txt":"use the SSRB"},{"t":66.2,"txt":"method. What is that? I just made it up"},{"t":69,"txt":"right now. It stands for sight, smell,"},{"t":72.6,"txt":"resistance, and blow things up. We're"},{"t":75,"txt":"going to do all four of those things in"},{"t":76.5,"txt":"this video. First, sight."},{"t":79.2,"txt":"Uh with sight, you look around in the"},{"t":80.9,"txt":"panel, look for whole sets of things"},{"t":84.2,"txt":"that have lost power."},{"t":85.9,"txt":"If you see anything with a red flashing"},{"t":87.6,"txt":"light on it, that's your fault. Uh sight"},{"t":91,"txt":"also comes into things like relays and"},{"t":93.3,"txt":"motor contactors. You pop them apart,"},{"t":95.6,"txt":"look for burn marks. Sight is very very"},{"t":99.2,"txt":"helpful. The good technicians are not"},{"t":101.5,"txt":"the people who know the most, they're"},{"t":103.2,"txt":"the ones who are most observant and ask"},{"t":105,"txt":"the right questions."},{"t":106.8,"txt":"Smell. Smell is easy."},{"t":114.5,"txt":"Wow."},{"t":115.8,"txt":"That's your problem. SSR resistance. I"},{"t":119.6,"txt":"can take my ohm meter out and check"},{"t":121.2,"txt":"resistance on different terminals. If"},{"t":123.3,"txt":"it's a transformer, I'm looking for, you"},{"t":125.6,"txt":"know, low resistance between the coils,"},{"t":127.9,"txt":"high resistance from coil to ground."},{"t":130.4,"txt":"Push in a contactor, measure the the"},{"t":132.7,"txt":"resistance on each set of leads, right?"},{"t":136.7,"txt":"So, when you push this in, you want 0"},{"t":138.6,"txt":"ohms, 0 ohms, 0 ohms. If you have one"},{"t":141.8,"txt":"that's an open circuit, you know you got"},{"t":143.3,"txt":"a bad contactor set of contacts."},{"t":155.2,"txt":"If you don't know, the way you check"},{"t":156.4,"txt":"resistance is you set your meter to"},{"t":160.3,"txt":"ohms or resistance"},{"t":163.7,"txt":"right there, and then you measure"},{"t":165.6,"txt":"resistance across the fuse like this."},{"t":171.2,"txt":"If it shows an open circuit, it's a bad"},{"t":173.6,"txt":"fuse. If it shows very low resistance,"},{"t":176.1,"txt":"it's a good fuse."},{"t":177.8,"txt":"So, use your sight, use smell, and"},{"t":181,"txt":"measure resistance. Those are the three"},{"t":182.8,"txt":"main things with troubleshooting that"},{"t":184.5,"txt":"most people forget to do."},{"t":188.1,"txt":"Now, our last one, B. We're going to"},{"t":190.8,"txt":"blow something up. What we're going to"},{"t":192.4,"txt":"do is we're going to troubleshoot this"},{"t":193.9,"txt":"power supply."},{"t":195.3,"txt":"What happened was I was troubleshooting"},{"t":196.6,"txt":"a panel, the power supply the the I saw"},{"t":200.2,"txt":"the 120 volts was coming in, and this"},{"t":202.5,"txt":"power supply is designed to send 24"},{"t":204.8,"txt":"volts DC out, you know, to power"},{"t":207.4,"txt":"different relays and control equipment."},{"t":209.9,"txt":"And none of that stuff was lit up lit"},{"t":211.7,"txt":"up. And not only that, but this OK"},{"t":214.5,"txt":"light, which is usually green, was not"},{"t":216.8,"txt":"illuminated at all. So, I knew right"},{"t":219.5,"txt":"away by using sight that A,"},{"t":223.2,"txt":"all of our 24 volts stuff does not have"},{"t":225.6,"txt":"power, all of it, and our power supply"},{"t":228.8,"txt":"did not have the OK light. So, I know"},{"t":231.2,"txt":"the issue lies inside of this power"},{"t":233.1,"txt":"supply."},{"t":234.3,"txt":"I measured voltage, made sure we're"},{"t":235.8,"txt":"getting power to the power supply, and I"},{"t":238,"txt":"knew that the problem was right here."},{"t":241,"txt":"Yeah, so I diagnosed that we know we"},{"t":242.6,"txt":"have a bad power supply. I swapped it"},{"t":244.5,"txt":"out, and everything started working, but"},{"t":247.2,"txt":"I took this power supply and said, \"Hey,"},{"t":248.9,"txt":"let's repair this power supply.\""},{"t":256.8,"txt":">>"},{"t":261.2,"txt":">> Now, for this portion of video, we're"},{"t":262.4,"txt":"really talking about"},{"t":264.1,"txt":"electronics."},{"t":265.6,"txt":"Um anything with a circuit board or"},{"t":267.9,"txt":">>"},{"t":268,"txt":">> a bunch of stuff working together in one"},{"t":270.3,"txt":"single machine. It could be your PLC. It"},{"t":273.5,"txt":"could be a power supply. It could be"},{"t":275.8,"txt":"that your multimeter won't turn on. It"},{"t":278,"txt":"could be, you know, the control board"},{"t":280.8,"txt":"for your air conditioner at home."},{"t":283.1,"txt":"Anything with a circuit board, that's"},{"t":285.7,"txt":"what we're going to talk about now. How"},{"t":286.8,"txt":"you can fix 70, 80, 90% of that that"},{"t":290.4,"txt":"sort of stuff with almost no technical"},{"t":292.1,"txt":"knowledge."},{"t":294.4,"txt":"So, I'm looking at this thing. I want to"},{"t":296.2,"txt":"fix it."},{"t":297.5,"txt":"How the heck do I fix it?"},{"t":300.3,"txt":"Taking a closer look, I mean, there's"},{"t":301.6,"txt":"nothing I can really do. There's just"},{"t":303.9,"txt":"these three terminals and these four"},{"t":305.6,"txt":"terminals. Power in, power out with an"},{"t":308.2,"txt":"indicator."},{"t":309.4,"txt":"Well,"},{"t":310.5,"txt":"maybe if I pop this cover off, we can"},{"t":312.1,"txt":"find some stuff out. I see there's"},{"t":313.7,"txt":"little torx bits. I pre-loosened those"},{"t":315.6,"txt":"for this video."},{"t":317.2,"txt":"Torx bits pop off, pull the cover off."},{"t":320.1,"txt":"Oh, it's stuck."},{"t":322,"txt":"Okay, there's a Phillips head."},{"t":324.4,"txt":"You don't need to be a rocket scientist"},{"t":325.6,"txt":"to figure that one out. Let me go get my"},{"t":327.2,"txt":"screwdriver."},{"t":331.6,"txt":"So, now I'm going to pop this off,"},{"t":333.6,"txt":"get it all the way out."},{"t":335.1,"txt":"You pop our cover off."},{"t":337.7,"txt":"Whoop."},{"t":339.3,"txt":"And now we're looking at the guts of our"},{"t":340.7,"txt":"component. Goes back to SSRB."},{"t":345.3,"txt":"The B is for blowing stuff up. I promise"},{"t":347.6,"txt":"it's coming soon."},{"t":350.2,"txt":"Shh. Oh my god, my son's crying."},{"t":352.6,"txt":"So, just take a quick look at the"},{"t":353.7,"txt":"components, look for explosion marks."},{"t":356.2,"txt":"Everything looks pretty good."},{"t":359.1,"txt":"If one of these components was literally"},{"t":360.8,"txt":"exploded, we would know that was our"},{"t":362.2,"txt":"problem."},{"t":366.1,"txt":"I smell"},{"t":367.9,"txt":"that burnt smell is coming from over"},{"t":369.4,"txt":"here. There's a little transformer."},{"t":371.3,"txt":"Looks a little dusty, little brown."},{"t":373.3,"txt":"Maybe it works, maybe it doesn't. But,"},{"t":376.2,"txt":"the most important thing,"},{"t":377.9,"txt":"just about every single electronic"},{"t":379.3,"txt":"component can just about every single"},{"t":381.8,"txt":"electronic component is going to have a"},{"t":383.1,"txt":"fuse."},{"t":384.7,"txt":"You see right there, that fuse is super"},{"t":387.2,"txt":"exploded. You can see the burn marks on"},{"t":389,"txt":"it. So,"},{"t":390.9,"txt":"long story short, if you have a faulted"},{"t":393.6,"txt":"electronic component, it will not turn"},{"t":395.5,"txt":"on or it has a red flashing fault light,"},{"t":398.1,"txt":"take it apart, find the fuse, swap the"},{"t":401.4,"txt":"fuse, and try it again."},{"t":412.9,"txt":"Now, we're going to do that and blow"},{"t":414.2,"txt":"this sucker up."},{"t":417.2,"txt":"Look how blown this fuse is."},{"t":419.5,"txt":"That's not a blown fuse, that's a"},{"t":421.3,"txt":"Hiroshima fuse. Hey."},{"t":426,"txt":"Okay, so we diagnosed a bad fuse. We're"},{"t":427.8,"txt":"going to look at the fuse rating. That"},{"t":429.3,"txt":"was a 6 amp fuse, so I'm going to go"},{"t":430.9,"txt":"pull out another 6 amp fuse. We're going"},{"t":433,"txt":"to put that fuse in, we're going to plug"},{"t":435,"txt":"this bad boy up, and we're going to see"},{"t":436.6,"txt":"what happens."},{"t":438,"txt":"All right, now I'm going to power this"},{"t":439,"txt":"thing up using this cable."},{"t":441.2,"txt":"The nickname for this thing rhymes with"},{"t":443.7,"txt":"Buddha abide cable, and there's a reason"},{"t":445.8,"txt":"for that."},{"t":447.5,"txt":"All right, here we go, people."},{"t":449.3,"txt":"We're going to do it."},{"t":455.9,"txt":">>"},{"t":474.3,"txt":">> Ooh, that's stinky. Oh my gosh."},{"t":477.3,"txt":"Yeehaw."},{"t":485.7,"txt":"Not to toot my own horn or sound"},{"t":487.6,"txt":"egotistical, I might be a little bit,"},{"t":489.6,"txt":"but I think generally I'm pretty level"},{"t":491.6,"txt":"in that regard, but I am a great"},{"t":494.6,"txt":"technician. I can fix just about"},{"t":497,"txt":"anything. It's very rare that I mean, it"},{"t":499.8,"txt":"it would take me a while to even"},{"t":500.8,"txt":"remember a time when I wasn't able to"},{"t":503,"txt":"repair something or at least figure out"},{"t":505,"txt":"a good path to repair it. Um"},{"t":508.7,"txt":"you don't need a lot of knowledge to be"},{"t":510.3,"txt":"a good technician."},{"t":512.2,"txt":"To be an amazing technician, you need to"},{"t":514.2,"txt":"know a lot of stuff. To be a pretty damn"},{"t":516.4,"txt":"good electrician,"},{"t":518.7,"txt":"technician, whatever,"},{"t":520.9,"txt":"to be a pretty good technician, you do"},{"t":522.9,"txt":"not need much technical skill at all."},{"t":525.5,"txt":"You need good communication skills,"},{"t":528.1,"txt":"patience, you need to be resourceful,"},{"t":530.5,"txt":"and you need common sense. And that's"},{"t":532,"txt":"what we're talking about here. If you go"},{"t":533.8,"txt":"to school, you go on your first job, and"},{"t":535.2,"txt":"you feel like you're lost, these are the"},{"t":537.3,"txt":"things that will set you apart from"},{"t":539.5,"txt":"other technicians, and people may even"},{"t":542.2,"txt":"perceive you as better than other more"},{"t":544.1,"txt":"skilled technicians. If you could just"},{"t":545.8,"txt":"slow down, you know, diagnosing the"},{"t":549,"txt":"biggest"},{"t":550.3,"txt":"a huge part of diagnosing faults is just"},{"t":552.7,"txt":"figuring out what works and what"},{"t":554.3,"txt":"doesn't. So, slow down, use your sight,"},{"t":558,"txt":"use your smell,"},{"t":560,"txt":"check resistance, and when no one's"},{"t":561.7,"txt":"looking, blow something up."},{"t":567.2,"txt":">>"}],"words":[{"t":7.56,"w":"All"},{"t":8.36,"w":"industrial"},{"t":9.68,"w":"equipment"},{"t":10.68,"w":"is"},{"t":10.84,"w":"designed"},{"t":11.96,"w":"so"},{"t":12.24,"w":"that"},{"t":12.6,"w":"anybody"},{"t":13.2,"w":"can"},{"t":13.4,"w":"fix"},{"t":13.76,"w":"it."},{"t":15.16,"w":"All"},{"t":15.32,"w":"industrial"},{"t":15.72,"w":"equipment"},{"t":16.32,"w":"is"},{"t":16.56,"w":"easy"},{"t":16.84,"w":"to"},{"t":16.96,"w":"fix."},{"t":17.68,"w":"All"},{"t":17.96,"w":"of"},{"t":18.08,"w":"it."},{"t":28.165,"w":">>